    {
      "Id": "2cb33a5e-1661-47b2-8458-9c768e61f848",
      "Description": "In this example, the [AnimBool] operator generates a boolean value that turns true for a single frame at the beginning of a bar.\nThis kind of signal is useful for events and rhythmic logic."
